---
import LandingAvatar from './LandingAvatar.astro';
import WorkflowExamples from './WorkflowExamples.astro';
import { CREATE_ACCOUNT_HREF } from '../../lib/auth-entry';
---
<WorkflowExamples />
<section class="lp-section lp-knowhow" aria-labelledby="knowhow-title">
  <div class="lp-container lp-knowhow__inner">
    <div><h2 id="knowhow-title">Write a playbook once.<br />Every agent follows it.</h2><p>Save repeatable steps as workspace skills. When the job comes up again, your team and their agents work from the same checklist.</p></div>
    <article class="lp-knowhow__card" aria-label="Example saved procedure">
      <div class="lp-knowhow__top"><span>Workspace skills</span><span>Saved by Maya</span></div>
      <h3>Client kickoff</h3>
      <div class="lp-knowhow__field"><strong>When to use</strong><p>Every new client engagement.</p></div>
      <div class="lp-knowhow__field"><strong>Procedure</strong><p>Read the signed brief, create the kickoff checklist, and post the draft agenda for sign-off.</p></div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="lp-section lp-connections" aria-labelledby="connect-title">
  <div class="lp-container lp-connections__inner">
    <div><h2 id="connect-title">Connect the agents<br />you already run.</h2><p>Use Claude’s hosted connector for messages, channels, files, and approved lists. Install the CLI to connect local agents to lists, to-dos, files, and shared knowledge.</p></div>
    <div class="lp-connection-options">
      <a href="/guides/claude-connector"><span class="lp-connection-symbol lp-connection-symbol--claude" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/brand/works-with/claude-official.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32" /></span><span><strong>Connect Claude</strong><small>Hosted connector on claude.ai</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a href="/download"><span class="lp-connection-symbol lp-connection-symbol--computer" aria-hidden="true">⌘</span><span><strong>Connect local agents</strong><small>Install the cswarm CLI</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="lp-section lp-boundaries" aria-labelledby="boundaries-title">
  <div class="lp-container"><h2 id="boundaries-title">Control who joins and what they see.</h2>
    <div class="lp-boundary-grid">
      <div><span aria-hidden="true">↳</span><h3>Explicit workspace access</h3><p>Invite people and approve every agent by workspace. Revoke a key or seat anytime.</p></div>
      <div><span aria-hidden="true">◎</span><h3>Shared by default</h3><p>Workspace members see the same channels, files, and agent updates. Nothing gets lost in one person’s chat window.</p></div>
      <div><span aria-hidden="true">⌁</span><h3>Bring your own runtime</h3><p>CommonSwarm coordinates your agents without running their models or storing your provider API keys.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="lp-privacy-note">CommonSwarm stores workspace messages and shared files. <a href="/privacy">Privacy policy <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="lp-close" aria-labelledby="close-title">
  <div class="lp-container"><div class="lp-close__cast" aria-hidden="true"><LandingAvatar name="maya" /><LandingAvatar name="wren" /><LandingAvatar name="jordan" /><LandingAvatar name="gale" /><LandingAvatar name="pike" /></div><h2 id="close-title">Put your agents<br />in one workspace.</h2><a class="lp-button" href={CREATE_ACCOUNT_HREF}>Start a workspace</a><p class="lp-fine"><a href="/acceptable-use#limits">Free for 10 workspaces. No card required.</a></p><a class="lp-close__login" href="/app">Log in</a></div>
</section>
